{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "adec4041-0578-88ac-b4ac-3eb861bf1730",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:45:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniel Goldberg",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:44:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:44:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Daniel Goldberg. I want to ask about a mobile vendor license for the summer. I plan to sell used goods from a table, and maybe from a cart."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:44:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A vendor license, for summer. Alright, so, um, usually that goes through our office, yes. Is this a cart you'd move around, or one spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:44:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not know yet. This is part of my question. Also, I sell small items with a pet. I have a rabies certificate for my dog. Is a copy of the certificate accepted, or do you require the original?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:45:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. I'm not sure why the dog certificate would go with the license. Is somebody asking you for it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:45:15-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I read it on a form. Maybe I read it wrong. I am not sure which form it was. I live at 115 Annandale Road, and I bargain hard at the flea market on Sundays, so I want to do this correctly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:45:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine. Let me check which application you saw. Copies are often fine for records, but I'd rather confirm. Can I call you back at the number I have?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:45:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0179. Please explain again, slowly, which paper is for the dog and which is for the license."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:45:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do, Mr. Goldberg. I'll sort it out and call you."
    }
  ],
